    {
      "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105165",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DIONYZA.\nWhy, are you foolish? Can it be undone?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105165/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105165/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 48,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4842107,
        "end": 4842185,
        "line": 180681,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap27/p@105165",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_27.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DIONYZA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105247",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLEON.\nO, Dionyza, such a piece of slaughter\nThe sun and moon ne’er look’d upon!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105247/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105247/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 44,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105247/line-3",
          "start": 45,
          "end": 80,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4842189,
        "end": 4842304,
        "line": 180686,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap27/p@105247",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_27.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CLEON.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105366",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DIONYZA.\nI think you’ll turn a child again.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105366/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105366/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 43,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4842308,
        "end": 4842381,
        "line": 180692,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap27/p@105366",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_27.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DIONYZA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105443",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLEON.\nWere I chief lord of all this spacious world,\nI’d give it to undo the deed. A lady,\nMuch less in blood than virtue, yet a princess\nTo equal any single crown o’ the earth\nI’ the justice of compare! O villain Leonine!\nWhom thou hast poison’d too:\nIf thou hadst drunk to him, ’t had been a kindness\nBecoming well thy face. What canst thou say\nWhen noble Pericles shall demand his child?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105443/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105443/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105443/line-3",
          "start": 53,
          "end": 90,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105443/line-4",
          "start": 91,
          "end": 137,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105443/line-5",
          "start": 138,
          "end": 176,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105443/line-6",
          "start": 177,
          "end": 222,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105443/line-7",
          "start": 223,
          "end": 251,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105443/line-8",
          "start": 252,
          "end": 302,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105443/line-9",
          "start": 303,
          "end": 346,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105443/line-10",
          "start": 347,
          "end": 390,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4842385,
        "end": 4842845,
        "line": 180697,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap27/p@105443",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_27.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CLEON.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105907",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DIONYZA.\nThat she is dead. Nurses are not the fates,\nTo foster it, nor ever to preserve.\nShe died at night; I’ll say so. Who can cross it?\nUnless you play the pious innocent,\nAnd for an honest attribute cry out\n‘She died by foul play.’",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105907/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105907/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105907/line-3",
          "start": 53,
          "end": 88,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105907/line-4",
          "start": 89,
          "end": 138,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105907/line-5",
          "start": 139,
          "end": 174,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105907/line-6",
          "start": 175,
          "end": 210,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@105907/line-7",
          "start": 211,
          "end": 235,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4842849,
        "end": 4843139,
        "line": 180710,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap27/p@105907",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_27.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DIONYZA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106201",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLEON.\nO, go to. Well, well,\nOf all the faults beneath the heavens, the gods\nDo like this worst.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106201/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106201/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 28,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106201/line-3",
          "start": 29,
          "end": 76,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106201/line-4",
          "start": 77,
          "end": 96,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4843143,
        "end": 4843279,
        "line": 180720,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap27/p@106201",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_27.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CLEON.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106341",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DIONYZA.\nBe one of those that thinks\nThe petty wrens of Tarsus will fly hence,\nAnd open this to Pericles. I do shame\nTo think of what a noble strain you are,\nAnd of how coward a spirit.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106341/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106341/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 36,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106341/line-3",
          "start": 37,
          "end": 78,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106341/line-4",
          "start": 79,
          "end": 116,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106341/line-5",
          "start": 117,
          "end": 157,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106341/line-6",
          "start": 158,
          "end": 185,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4843283,
        "end": 4843518,
        "line": 180727,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap27/p@106341",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_27.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DIONYZA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106580",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLEON.\nTo such proceeding\nWhoever but his approbation added,\nThough not his prime consent, he did not flow\nFrom honourable courses.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106580/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106580/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 25,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106580/line-3",
          "start": 26,
          "end": 60,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106580/line-4",
          "start": 61,
          "end": 106,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106580/line-5",
          "start": 107,
          "end": 131,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4843522,
        "end": 4843698,
        "line": 180736,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap27/p@106580",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_27.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CLEON.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106760",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DIONYZA.\nBe it so, then:\nYet none does know, but you, how she came dead,\nNor none can know, Leonine being gone.\nShe did distain my child, and stood between\nHer and her fortunes: none would look on her,\nBut cast their gazes on Marina’s face;\nWhilst ours was blurted at and held a malkin\nNot worth the time of day. It pierced me through;\nAnd though you call my course unnatural,\nYou not your child well loving, yet I find\nIt greets me as an enterprise of kindness\nPerform’d to your sole daughter.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106760/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106760/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 24,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106760/line-3",
          "start": 25,
          "end": 72,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneIV_27.3/p@106760/line-4",
